  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      377.62,
      541.91,
      523.98
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired* are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Okewela Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office on the 02nd September, 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 26th August, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
